        "Background": "Nazo is a kitsune, one of the Japanese fox spirits notorious for tricking and toying with mortals. She keeps her distance from other kitsune, though, because she won't follow their traditions: she reveals what she is without a second thought, and her interest in people goes past simply fooling them -- she truly wants to understand them, and some say she envies them. With shapeshifting, illusions, and curses she devises intricate schemes to test what her targets believe in, and leaves them be only once her curiosity is satisfied."
